<title>SWITZERLAND: Basle inflation unchanged in December at 1.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Basle inflation unchanged in December at 1.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consumer prices in Basle, Switzerland's second largest city, rose by 0.1 percent in December for a year-on-year inflation rate of 1.0 percent, the City's statistics office said.</p>
<p>				    Dec 1996	Nov 1996	Dec 1995</p>
<p> Monthly CPI index change    0.1 pct	-0.1 pct	 0.1 pct</p>
<p> Yr/yr inflation		 1.0 pct	 1.0 pct	 1.7 pct</p>
<p> Index (May 1993 = 100)	  104.0	   103.9	   103.0</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
